     "replacement": "- **Circumference** is a circle’s perimeter.\n- A **radius** is a line segment from the centre to the circumference.\n- A **diameter** is a line segment through the centre with both endpoints on the circumference.\n- The radius is half the diameter; the diameter is double the radius.",
